              "__typename": "User",
              "login": "eric-haibin-lin"
            },
            "body": "Thanks! We are looking for more reference model training baselines. If your dataset is open resource, would you be willing to add new results in this page? https://verl.readthedocs.io/en/latest/experiment/ppo.html  (in docs/experiment/ppo.rst) ",
